[tag 3.11.1]

Updating:
- cd $topsrcdir/comm
- ../mach vendor -r <tag_name> --patch-mode none third_party/botan/moz.yaml
- ../mach vendor --patch-mode only third_party/botan/moz.yaml
- Review the changes
- Commit the changes

The tag information in this file is automatically updated. The moz.yaml file
is automatically updated. If upstream changes require updating moz.build or
botan.mozbuild, that must be done with a manual step.

